  "description": "PostgreSQL database provider for Rapidex.Data ORM framework.\n\nThis package provides PostgreSQL specific implementation for the Rapidex.Data framework, enabling full support for PostgreSQL databases.\n\nFeatures:\n• Full PostgreSQL support for Rapidex.Data\n• Optimized SQL generation for PostgreSQL\n• Support for PostgreSQL specific data types\n• Transaction support with PostgreSQL\n• Multi-schema support (PostgreSQL schemas)\n• Automatic schema creation and updates\n• Connection pooling support\n• JSONB support\n\nRequires Rapidex.Data package (which includes all necessary dependencies).",
